# Blade & Livewire

## Blade
- Use Tailwind CSS classes. No inline styles except in PDF templates.
- All text must use `{{ __('...') }}` for translation.
- Use components (`<x-component>`) over `@include` where possible.
- Keep logic out of Blade: use view composers or computed properties.

## Livewire Components
- Livewire handles UI state only. Delegate business logic to services.
- Use `wire:loading` for loading states on all actions.
- Validate with `$this->validate()` rules, not inline checks.

```php
// BAD: business logic in Livewire
public function updateStatus($status) {
    if ($this->order->status === 'paid' && $status === 'shipped') {
        $this->order->update(['status' => $status]);
        event(new OrderStatusChanged($this->order));
    }
}

// GOOD: delegate to service
public function updateStatus($status, OrderStatusService $service) {
    $service->transitionTo($this->order, $status);
    $this->order->refresh();
}
```
